  ($a42$Legislative Duties$a42$, $a43$Senate$a43$, $a44$Sponsored bills$a44$, $a45$["Federal University of Occupational & Skills Development (Establishment) Bill, 2024 (SB.197)","Federal University of Geomatics (Establishment) Bill, 2024 (SB.497)","Federal University of Education (Special), Oyo (Establishment) Bill, 2024","Federal Polytechnic, Arole (Establishment) Bill, 2025 (SB.859)","Motorists' Council (Amendment) Bill, 2025 (SB.914)","Matrimonial Causes (Amendment) Bill, 2025 (SB.944)","Motor Vehicle (Prohibition of Tinted Glass) (Amendment) Act, 2025 (SB.945)","Mandatory Payment of Child Support by Biological Fathers Act, 2025 (SB.947)","Federal Medical Centres Act (Amendment) Bill, 2025 (SB.1017)","100-Bed Mother and Child Hospital at Ona-Ara Local Government"]$a45$::jsonb, $a46$Motions$a46$, $a47$["Need to halt the proposed increase in electricity tariff by the 11 successor electricity distribution companies (DISCOs), July 2023.","Appeal to Resident Doctors to suspend the pending nationwide industrial strike, 28th July 2023."]$a47$::jsonb, 70)
